Begin2
Title        =The Andrew User Interface System - Mail System
Version      =63L2  6.3.1 Linux version
Desc1        =Latest version of AUIS (aka ATK) 6.3.1
Desc2        =AUIS is an integrated set of tools that allow you to create,
Desc3        =use, and mail multi-media documents and apps containing
Desc4        =formatted text and embedded objects.
Desc5        =This package is aimed at those needing A BETTER MAIL INTERFACE
Desc6        =and those interested in a MULTI-MEDIA (MIME) MAIL INTERFACE
Author       =Andrew Consortium
AuthorEmail  =info-andrew-request@andrew.cmu.edu
Maintainer   =Terry Gliedt
MaintEmail   =tpg@mr.net 
Site1        =sunsite.unc.edu
Path1        =pub/Linux/X11/andrew
File1        =auis63L2-mail.tgz
FileSize1    =2.0MB
Required1    =YOU MUST HAVE INSTALLED AUIS63L2-WP.TGZ FIRST.
Required2    =/bin/csh  (e.g. ln -sf /bin/tcsh /bin/csh)
Required3    =X Window System
Required4    =A WORKING MAIL SYSTEM (using mail/elm or whatever).
CopyPolicy1  =Use, copy, modify, and distribute this software and its
CopyPolicy2  =documentation for any purpose is granted without fee.
Keywords     =ATK, AUIS, multi-media, MIME
Comment1     =Installation instructions as ROOT:
Comment2     =   cd /
Comment3     =   tar xzf [path]/auis63L?-mail.tgz
Comment4     =   /usr/andrew/etc/complete-setup mail
Comment5     =   Read /usr/andrew/README.mail
RelFiles1    =Adds to directory tree /usr/andrew
Entered      =25SEP94
EnteredBy    =Terry Gliedt
CheckedEmail =tpg@mr.net
End

